{"source":"github","project_id":"textdata","target":"EmilHvitfeldt/textdata","id":"pr/11","ref":11,"title":"Add NRC lexicon to textdata","description":"I worked on adding the NRC emotion lexicon to textdata this evening, to address #10 and other issues hanging out in tidytext and the tidytext book. \r\n\r\n## BAD NEWS 😩\r\n\r\nThe [links on the NRC site are all http](http://sentiment.nrc.ca/lexicons-for-research/), not https.\r\n\r\nThe [CRAN policies](https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/policies.html) say this:\r\n\r\n\u003e Downloads of additional software or data as part of package installation or startup should only use secure download mechanisms (e.g., ‘https’ or ‘ftps’).\r\n\r\nWhat do you think our options are? Any ideas?","published_at":"2019-07-12T18:26:58Z","updated_at":"2019-07-15T18:05:07Z","url":"https://github.com/EmilHvitfeldt/textdata/pull/11","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"juliasilge","merged_at":"2019-07-15T18:05:07Z","state":"MERGED"}}
